  "translation": "Today is Sunday. My mom and I went to the supermarket together from home. There were many people in the supermarket, and we were buying things there. Mom bought apples and milk. How much were the apples? One apple cost 2.5 yuan, so mom bought three apples. Milk was 3 yuan per cup, and mom gave 10 yuan. The shop assistant gave me 5.5 yuan in change. I saw some bread. This bread was very delicious, so I said I wanted to buy another one. Mom agreed, and we bought the bread. Then we went home. I ate the bread and an apple. I drank milk and I can also drink water. Both the apples and milk were very good. I am not tired; I am very happy."
